Custom Start Framework / 自定义开局框架

=== English ===
1.0.1

- After Lower Levels rep injection, Wild Favor is restored by default so factionReputationDelta.lower does not grant free network points via the game's ×40 sync
- New profile field compensateWildFavorForLowerRep (default true); set false to keep the old behavior
- New profile fields alongside extraCash / extraRent: contrabandMarkupDelta (per tier or uniform int), baseStoreAttractivenessDelta; retailMarkupDelta supported in JSON (hidden in editor for now)
- Editor tab renamed to Economy / Store; retail markup input temporarily removed from editor UI

1.0.0

First release. Install CustomStartFramework-1.0.0.dll → Mods/CustomStartFramework.dll.

- Perk-driven custom starts via UserData/custom-start/{id}/profile.json; auto-scanned on mod load
- When the perk is active: inject items / removeItems, extraCash / extraRent, unlockedUpgrades, factionReputationDelta
- allowedStartTypes limits visible start types; [] or omitted = all start types
- Optional icon.png; name / description support zh/en in profile JSON and follow the game locale at runtime
- Release includes editor/ profile tool

=== 中文 ===
1.0.1

- 下层区声望注入后默认恢复王尔德的恩惠（Wild Favor），避免 factionReputationDelta.lower 经游戏 ×40 换算白送网络升级点数
- profile.json 新增 compensateWildFavorForLowerRep（默认 true）；设为 false 可恢复旧行为
- profile.json 新增与 extraCash / extraRent 并列的经济字段：contrabandMarkupDelta（分级或统一整数）、baseStoreAttractivenessDelta；retailMarkupDelta 仍可在 JSON 中配置（编辑器暂隐藏）
- 编辑器「经济/店铺」页签；零售加价输入暂从编辑器移除

1.0.0

首版发布。安装 CustomStartFramework-1.0.0.dll → 游戏 Mods/CustomStartFramework.dll。

- Perk 驱动：UserData/custom-start/{id}/profile.json 定义开局，Mod 启动时自动扫描注册
- 新游戏选中对应 Perk 后注入：items / removeItems、extraCash / extraRent、unlockedUpgrades、factionReputationDelta
- allowedStartTypes 绑定起始职业；[] 或未配置 = 全部职业可见
- 可选 icon.png 自定义 Perk 图标；name / description 支持中英文，运行时随游戏语言切换
- 发布包含 editor/ 配置编辑器
